   코스어들이 이용자를 반겨준다
  &lt;/figcaption&gt;
 &lt;/figure&gt;
 &lt;figure&gt;
  &lt;img alt="간단한 미니게임" src="https://game.donga.com/media/__sized__/images/2026/4/29/756ba55aa0ac491c-thumbnail-1920x1080-70.jpg"/&gt;
  &lt;figcaption&gt;
   간단한 미니게임
  &lt;/figcaption&gt;
 &lt;/figure&gt;
 &lt;figure&gt;
  &lt;img alt="응원의 메시지를 직접 남길 수 있다" src="https://game.donga.com/media/__sized__/images/2026/4/29/11f9593b7437439f-thumbnail-1920x1080-70.jpg"/&gt;
